0..54 Comment "//! A case can omit an unreachable indexed-family arm."
55..58 Comment "//!"
59..91 Comment "//! `vhead` has index `Succ(n)`."
92..118 Comment "//! `VNil` has index zero."
119..122 Comment "//!"
123..199 Comment "//! Each branch of a case on an indexed family binds a path past its fields."
200..271 Comment "//! The path runs from the index of its constructor to the index of the"
272..286 Comment "//! scrutinee."
287..348 Comment "//! An omitted arm eliminates the path between those indices."
349..381 Comment "//! Apart endpoints need no arm."
382..385 Comment "//!"
386..436 Comment "//! - cites: [Cockx-2016-unifiers_as_equivalences]"
437..519 Comment "//! - see: `../../pathological/data/vector-head.gandr` — the checker refuses the"
520..569 Comment "//!   omission of an arm whose ends are not apart"
570..573 Comment "//!"
574..713 Comment "//! [Cockx-2016-unifiers_as_equivalences]: https://doi.org/10.1145/2951913.2951917 \"Cockx, Devriese and Piessens, Unifiers as equivalences\""
715..752 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
